  "passageHtml": "<h2>READING PASSAGE 1</h2><h3>The problems and benefits created by the spread of the water hyacinth in Kenya</h3><p>In east Africa the plant arrived with <span class='hl' id='hl-q1' data-q='[Q1]'>Belgian colonists in Rwanda, who liked the look of its <span class='kw'>glossy leaves and delicate purple flowers</span></span>... <span class='hl' id='hl-q2' data-q='[Q2]'>it had <span class='kw'>'escaped' out of the country via the Kagera river</span></span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q3' data-q='[Q3]'>the boats that once brought the fish to shore <span class='kw'>struggle to navigate</span> through the mass of plants</span>... <span class='hl' id='hl-q5' data-q='[Q5-NG]'>About three out of four families in Kenya depend on wood or charcoal...</span></p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q6' data-q='[Q6]'>huge piles of water hyacinth that villagers had <span class='kw'>taken out of the water</span>... were a common sight</span>... <span class='hl' id='hl-q7' data-q='[Q7]'>has captivated researchers' imaginations <span class='kw'>since as early as the 1980s</span></span>.</p><p>In 2018, the technology came to Dunga... <span class='hl' id='hl-q8' data-q='[Q8]'>transform a mix of water hyacinth and <span class='kw'>cow dung</span></span> into biogas.</p><p>Over the next 20 to 30 days, it <span class='hl' id='hl-q9' data-q='[Q9]'>goes through a <span class='kw'>fermentation</span> process</span>... clean-burning gas is <span class='hl' id='hl-q10' data-q='[Q10]'>passed through <span class='kw'>pipes</span></span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q11' data-q='[Q11]'>they don't have to devote a lot of <span class='kw'>time</span> every day to gathering firewood</span>... <span class='hl' id='hl-q12' data-q='[Q12]'>they're able to make more <span class='kw'>money</span></span> for their families.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q13' data-q='[Q13]'>unless the <span class='kw'>price</span> of the machines drops</span>, most communities will never be able to afford any.</p>",
  "questionHtml": "<div class='section-title'>Questions 1-7</div><div class='question' id='q1'><p><b>1.</b> Introduced as a decorative plant.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q1' value='TRUE'> TRUE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q1' value='FALSE'> FALSE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q1' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> TRUE</div></div><div class='question' id='q2'><p><b>2.</b> Fishermen took plants to Lake Victoria.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q2' value='TRUE'> TRUE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q2' value='FALSE'> FALSE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q2' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> FALSE</div></div><div class='question' id='q3'><p><b>3.</b> Difficult to force boats through thick plants.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q3' value='TRUE'> TRUE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q3' value='FALSE'> FALSE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q3' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> TRUE</div></div><div class='question' id='q4'><p><b>4.</b> Chemicals affecting numbers of fish.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q4' value='TRUE'> TRUE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q4' value='FALSE'> FALSE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q4' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> NOT GIVEN</div></div><div class='question' id='q5'><p><b>5.</b> Cooking with charcoal worse than wood.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q5' value='TRUE'> TRUE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q5' value='FALSE'> FALSE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q5' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> NOT GIVEN</div></div><div class='question' id='q6'><p><b>6.</b> Impossible to remove much water hyacinth.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q6' value='TRUE'> TRUE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q6' value='FALSE'> FALSE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q6' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> FALSE</div></div><div class='question' id='q7'><p><b>7.</b> Investigating possibility in the last century.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q7' value='TRUE'> TRUE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q7' value='FALSE'> FALSE</label><label><input type='radio' name='q7' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> TRUE</div></div><div class='section-title'>Questions 8-13</div><div class='question' id='q8'>Place water hyacinth together with some <b>8.</b> <input type='text' id='q8_input' class='fill-input'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> cow dung</div></div><div class='question' id='q9'>until the <b>9.</b> <input type='text' id='q9_input' class='fill-input'> is completed<div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> fermentation</div></div><div class='question' id='q10'>Use <b>10.</b> <input type='text' id='q10_input' class='fill-input'> to transport gas<div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> pipes</div></div><div class='question' id='q11'>no need to spend so much <b>11.</b> <input type='text' id='q11_input' class='fill-input'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> time</div></div><div class='question' id='q12'>bring in <b>12.</b> <input type='text' id='q12_input' class='fill-input'> for families<div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> money</div></div><div class='question' id='q13'>The <b>13.</b> <input type='text' id='q13_input' class='fill-input'> is beyond reach<div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> price</div></div><button class='btn-submit' onclick='checkAnswers()'>CHẤM BÀI VÀ NỘP KẾT QUẢ</button>"
